Package: inflammagingClock
Title: Apply the Inflammaging Clock
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Yufan", "Yang", email = "Yufan.Yang@unimedizin-mainz.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Apply a frozen inflammaging clock to new Olink Explore HT
    measurements. Assays are matched using HGNC gene symbols, replicate
    assays are averaged within each sample, and missing features are filled
    with the medians saved during training. The clock can be included within
    the installed package; no model fitting or recalibration is performed.
